### Create sample
# @name create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/samples
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "c-123",
  "item": "laptop",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Get sample by id (uses id from "Create sample" response)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/samples/{{create.response.body.sampleId}}

### Get all samples
GET http://localhost:8080/api/samples

### Not found (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/samples/does-not-exist

### Validation failure (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/samples
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "",
  "item": "laptop",
  "quantity": 0
}
